                <l xml:id="m-2bb4c5c9-b4bc-4b0c-9e52-4e8aa5125f5e" facs="#m-8ee3681c-3b39-475a-bd67-af28a967cf54" label="text-like">The Dedication of a Church. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-2b38861d-ecb5-4824-9907-daa632ce4ce2" facs="#m-f0caf841-1637-423e-9363-fcaf459b5f8f" label="ambiguous">1241</l><l xml:id="m-67e1a011-55aa-4a24-9537-29a5f82ab1db" facs="#m-fe2bb8e2-485f-44bc-9143-86b2c4327c3b" label="lyrics-like">bí¬</l><l xml:id="m-71c4b6fb-d92b-4206-93d9-c8526f0456a3" facs="#m-13ec6b55-e3d8-45c2-a86d-7354567c4658" label="lyrics-like">li-ter “déx-te-ra tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-c07c9321-dd74-46a2-badc-4bb1b2c80d1b" facs="#m-0a083fe0-6b54-4070-a6cb-eb0783495d62" label="ambiguous">a.</l><l xml:id="m-7c0b1a22-5cb0-44f7-abe1-a6cc47af3d2a" facs="#m-8a5ca9f0-d32c-4c9e-9268-bc8091a92417" label="lyrics-like">Alleluia, allelúia. V. Spécie túa. p. 1218.</l><l xml:id="m-22dca46f-3ede-4eb7-9292-b824157ce295" facs="#m-8a9e88d0-10a6-4b59-9388-a1aed2c3850d" label="lyrics-like">After Septuagesima, the Allelúia. and its Verse are omitted. The Tract</l><l xml:id="m-9ec62d43-9a1c-476e-bec8-88e28d3ca585" facs="#m-b7e8dee7-d368-4ec8-89b8-a907cd5c2a26" label="lyrics-like">Véni spónsa Christi. p. 1217, is said, but the ending words of the first V. are</l><l xml:id="m-e4b26fc8-485b-44a4-997c-1ce3f463e9e3" facs="#m-9849b77f-40fc-4ce1-b7c7-54f240e564b4" label="lyrics-like">omitted : * pro cujus amóre... fudisti.</l><l xml:id="m-eb0dc09d-f9a3-4f3b-9429-e9f508d7bb3f" facs="#m-d6f0e3a9-42e6-45a1-a846-4de5e3cc0f94" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time, the Gradual is omitted. The Alleluia, alleluia. V. Spécie</l><l xml:id="m-ed2cc11d-f75a-4cc4-979e-e05eef2f8c26" facs="#m-e4049a5b-d5f4-4c9d-89f9-fc94f488675f" label="lyrics-like">túa. p. 1218, is said instead, and then Allelúia. V. Propter veritátem. 5. 1237.</l><l xml:id="m-40be7801-bc08-42bc-bdae-6c262784df3b" facs="#m-2d5dc44d-b5dc-46bd-854b-651c6d611dec" label="lyrics-like">Gospel. Simile est regnum caelórum. p. 1223.</l><l xml:id="m-6fce2fda-0ccb-41a1-997f-df35fdc852ba" facs="#m-adcd58ac-1b74-46ca-a1e3-69f7ca4db647" label="lyrics-like">offertory. Diffúsa est. p. 1223.</l><l xml:id="m-2a2df3de-5291-41ad-97ca-1c27d34b99f4" facs="#m-c7babf3f-acd2-42f7-9d07-77f458477bdf" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Accépta tibi sit. p. 1228.</l><l xml:id="m-56e322a1-b221-47a2-82b3-3e57e000b3e1" facs="#m-224ee557-82fa-4e6d-bcc0-4dd5d58ab048" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-13d3cce9-14fd-44f9-8be7-fe5557b0c7b7" facs="#m-def13e97-479f-4dc8-854b-cc89438af7de" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-78eef499-d26a-41ce-b7a9-f1c4638d4916" facs="#m-53d20068-f157-4fbd-aeff-a0604d5c66c2" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-3d0c8567-7784-4d87-ae20-1182698e0e4f" facs="#m-9a59e1c1-0895-4a1d-be07-094008727828" label="lyrics-like">I-lexí-sti</l><l xml:id="m-40ac707d-3563-4a76-8a33-b5be51eb2429" facs="#m-90e55d0e-463a-4111-9fef-0fc482abdba1" label="lyrics-like">justí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8450f93e-2395-4ec3-95f1-24a2c14e6c0c" facs="#m-dd187129-9ef0-4919-9732-11e64c36e9a8" label="lyrics-like">ti- am, et odí¬</l><l xml:id="m-25b19fbe-c8a4-4009-b4c3-8725df5a0b35" facs="#m-509f9fca-cceb-42c9-9eb6-0c7279eba63f" label="lyrics-like">in-iquitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-288e8c9c-598d-4a1f-9bb6-36d306e39ef6" facs="#m-d610774c-3f7c-45d9-a6df-e8d33d46f197" label="lyrics-like">tem: proptér- e a únxit te</l><l xml:id="m-1222a762-3802-45f2-b65d-9d127d26dda1" facs="#m-a1b913d9-4ef0-449d-a382-d86a14801917" label="ambiguous">sti</l><l xml:id="m-e3fb4f8a-6175-47ac-bb4a-8d567d2333b0" facs="#m-4ec64bb0-e7d1-4325-b461-50f6152148cc" label="lyrics-like">us. T. P. Alle- lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-d51f2778-d0d7-4f91-965d-a0921e695719" facs="#m-d3c4e123-ad56-40ed-ac02-a42f35597be0" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c21bbee5-3f1a-4df3-9e85-878f7c5c635c" facs="#m-523eb0d1-2e72-472c-b73a-9446c190aa2d" label="lyrics-like">us, Dé¬ us tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-94145695-1af5-4127-93f8-a9a91137aa61" facs="#m-39e86ce8-0831-4549-872a-c60aa7c8e50a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-7f404341-5b2e-431c-8273-84044c8b0448" facs="#m-f1815dad-967c-44c0-9eff-d002bfc8e3fa" label="lyrics-like">NAtiásti, Dómine, familiam tuam fove, cujus solémnia celebrámus.</l><l xml:id="m-f1a75206-246e-454f-87f1-641e524218d8" facs="#m-dc1d28a8-e295-4db9-8fdd-bfe5e06a9574" label="lyrics-like">munéribus sacris: ejus quaésu-] Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-f561faba-a593-45a2-80b0-02f37b9b9d7e" facs="#m-4afba0d5-b841-459f-8c1c-658be8acff9e" label="lyrics-like">mus semper interventióne nos ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-73ba9c1b-ae11-4eef-b16e-11f99b97af2b" facs="#m-4d09805e-97fc-4bda-9dc1-6cf13c98faf0" label="ambiguous">COMMON</l><l xml:id="m-adb63fd6-b540-4548-837c-3cfcac48b410" facs="#m-3d5ce4b5-a45c-4816-9436-cdc971cc63e1" label="text-like">OF THE DEDICATION OF A CHURCH.</l><l xml:id="m-2f2b4ce5-0ed1-424e-8d93-9ee10c7554af" facs="#m-9ce5de7c-e093-4fc6-b4cf-e07f6d4cce0b" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-fc7f1ca5-c15b-45e3-88d4-b1b7e76f9b10" facs="#m-8add419e-c601-4641-8d85-81a54c336303" label="text-like">Psalms. Antiphons, Chapter and Hymn of second Vespers, p. 1246.</l><l xml:id="m-8a834103-422f-45dc-912e-884961505b95" facs="#m-654d0e5e-6de1-4121-9008-e76e3b4625a4" label="lyrics-like">v. Haec est dómus Dómini firmiter aedificáta. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-18dd6062-b53f-4b11-aa17-c72a5079f1f6" facs="#m-4695b501-2579-46c1-a905-befa6e438c30" label="lyrics-like">K. Bene fundáta est supra firmam pétram. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>